          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">CompletableFuture</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">supplyAsync</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(() </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">    .</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">thenApply</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(x </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> x </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">+</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);               </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 异步靠线程池与 Future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">Thread</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">sleep</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">100</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);                        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 会真的阻塞线程，与 await 不同</span></span></code></pre>",
